    <string name="permission_title">Permissions</string>
    <string name="permission_rationale">Bluetooth is needed to read the chest strap and to write to the RunStick. Location is needed because pace comes from GPS — nothing is stored or sent anywhere. Notifications are needed for the ongoing run notification. In Simulate mode, location is not requested.</string>
