    <string name="trimmed_title">Why this run was trimmed</string>
    <string name="trimmed_message">The run stopped itself because no heart rate arrived for %1$d minutes. That usually means the strap came off and Stop was not pressed.\n\nRecorded: %2$s\nKept: %3$s\n\nEverything after the last heartbeat was removed, so the time, distance and Strava upload all end at the last heartbeat. Press Stop yourself to keep the full recording.</string>
